  "reusable_conclusions": [
    {
      "text": "Flame Reave 命中模型技能模板（Mage / Spellblade，case flame-reave）",
      "source": "$.title.zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "主技能 ability_id=fr11mv；职业=Mage；专精=Spellblade；伤害标签=Fire、Melee",
      "source": "$.ability_id/class/mastery/damage_tags"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算组件：fr11mv:fire，kind=hit，damage_type=Fire，tags=Fire/Melee/Hit；base 值与 added_damage_scaling 不在模板抄写，运行时从 dataset/snapshot 读取；非 Fire typed added 不进入本组件（fire_only，见 unsupported）",
      "source": "$.components[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算块 tag_match → le_calc.hit_damage.tags_apply；组件标签闭包 {Fire,Melee,Hit}；Elemental 展开；Spell/DoT-only 排除（机制 fr-hit-tag-matching；共享算子 common-tag-match）",
      "source": "$.calculation_blocks[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算块 added_scaling → le_calc.hit_damage._component_added_pool；added 分池 + fire_only 策略 + added_damage_scaling（机制 fr-hit-added-scaling）",
      "source": "$.calculation_blocks[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算块 increased_aggregate → le_calc.hit_damage.compute_single_hit；increased 加算池（机制 fr-hit-increased-pools；共享算子 common-increased-aggregate）",
      "source": "$.calculation_blocks[2]"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算块 more_groups → le_calc.hit_damage._more_groups；按 group 汇总后组间相乘（机制 fr-hit-more-groups；共享算子 common-more-groups）",
      "source": "$.calculation_blocks[3]"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算块 crit → le_calc.hit_damage._crit_section；crit chance/multi 池、cap 与 avg crit（机制 fr-hit-critical-expected；共享算子条目未含 crit 块，见 docs/mechanisms.md 的已知缺口）",
      "source": "$.calculation_blocks[4]"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算块 target_side → le_calc.hit_damage.resolve_target；穿透 ×(1+sum pen)、火抗、怪物 DR（机制 fr-hit-target-side；共享算子 common-target-resistance-penetration / common-monster-dr）",
      "source": "$.calculation_blocks[5]"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算块 frequency → le_calc.hit_simulate.simulate；攻速/冷却/hit weights/窗口/rotation（机制 fr-hit-attack-speed、fr-hit-cooldown-icr、fr-hit-events-weights、fr-hit-rhythm-rotation；共享算子 common-frequency-cooldown）",
      "source": "$.calculation_blocks[6]"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算块 ledger → le_calc.hit_report.build_source_ledger_rows；来源/规则账投影（机制 fr-hit-single-hit-chain；共享算子 common-ledger）；rule ledger 见 build_rule_ledger_rows",
      "source": "$.calculation_blocks[7]"
    },
    {
